              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-21895",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2026-21895\nSeverity: LOW\nPackage: rsa\nFixed Version: 0.9.10\nLink: [CVE-2026-21895](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-21895)\nThe `rsa` crate is an RSA implementation written in rust. Prior to version 0.9.10, when creating a RSA private key from its components, the construction panics instead of returning an error when one of the primes is `1`. Version 0.9.10 fixes the issue.",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2026-21895**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|LOW|rsa|0.9.10|[CVE-2026-21895](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-21895)|\n\nThe `rsa` crate is an RSA implementation written in rust. Prior to version 0.9.10, when creating a RSA private key from its components, the construction panics instead of returning an error when one of the primes is `1`. Version 0.9.10 fixes the issue."
              },
              "properties": {
                "cvssv40_baseScore": 2.7,
                "cvssv40_vector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:N/VI:N/VA:L/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N/E:U",
                "precision": "very-high",
                "security-severity": "2.0",
                "tags": [
